  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "FABL: Formal Analysis of Boolean Functions in Lean",
  "excerpt": "FABL is a Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of Ryan O'Donnell's [*Analysis of Boolean Functions*](https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.10386), following the May 2021 edition. It develops the book's results as a reusable theorem library while preserving the domains, normalizations, and hypotheses of the original statements."
